# (d) Claude calls compact_after_turn during a turn: the mod compacts ~1 s after the turn completes.
title:   Compacting on request, right after the turn
caption: Claude can ask for a compact itself with the compact_after_turn tool. The mod waits for the turn to finish, gives it a one-second beat, then compacts, with no idle wait and no token threshold.
note:    1 column = 0.25 s. The one-second delay lets the turn settle before /compact runs.

time                    0   1s  2s
claude   -S~~~~~~~~~~~~~E-----------
tool     ------t--------------------
clock                   [===F
compact  --------------------C------

legend
S  turn.start      plum
~  turn            plum
t  compact_after_turn — tool call  plum
E  turn.complete  sky
=  1 s — clock.after(1000)  sand
F  fires — 1 s later  sand
C  compact  sage
